cicada audition <score.cicada> [flags]

report what a score sounds like

Flags:
  -o <directory>   write spectrogram.png, chroma.png and rhythm.png
  --from <bar>     one-based start bar (default 1)
  --bars <n>       bars to analyze; 0 means through song end
  --json           write the report as JSON (format cicada.audition/1)
  --help           show this help

Renders the mix and stems, then reports heard key, written and heard chords per bar, and per-track level, brightness, attack, decay and rhythm. See docs/manual/audition.md.
